RTX Housing System - What's New (v30.0)

A massive update. This version adds a full mortgage/financing system, a real estate agent economy, custom property types, developer exports, big safety and quality-of-life improvements, and a lot more. Each feature lists its Config option so you know exactly what to set.

Mortgage / Financing (headline feature)

Players can now buy a property with a mortgage instead of paying the full price up front.

In the purchase menu there's a new "Buy with mortgage" option, with a clear confirmation showing the down payment, financed amount, interest, per-installment cost, number of installments, and the payment cycle. The player owns the property immediately and owes the remaining balance to the bank. Each cycle an installment is added to the property's Bills, paid manually like any other bill - on its own configurable billing cycle, independent of your rent/tax settings. A polished Mortgage panel in the management dashboard shows remaining balance, amount due, installment, installments left, and a payoff progress bar - with "Pay off remaining" and "End mortgage" buttons. Anti-exploit built in: a mortgaged property cannot be sold to the bank, and selling/transferring it to another player carries the mortgage over to the new owner. Miss too many payments (configurable grace period) and the property is repossessed. Config: Config.Mortgage - enabled, downPaymentPercent, interestPercent, installments, billCycle = { amount, unit }, gracePeriod, label. Custom Property Types

Define your own property types with their own behavior - Offices, Warehouses, Labs, Nightclubs, or anything you invent, on Shell or IPL.

Player owned or public - each custom property can either be player owned (bought and owned like any normal property), or set to public access. Public access / open properties - a property doesn't have to be owned. Mark it as public and anyone can enter it freely without buying it (perfect for offices, shops, clubs, and public buildings). Config: Config.EnableCustomPropertyTypes (master switch), Config.CustomPropertyTypes. Public access is a per-property toggle in the property creator. Real Estate Agent System

Run property sales as a real estate business - decide which properties can only be sold or rented through a real estate agent instead of being bought normally.

Pick exactly which properties are real-estate-only with a per-property toggle in the property creator - only those go through the agent system, the rest work as usual. Or flip one option to make every property real-estate-only at once. On a restricted property, regular players can't Buy/Rent - they see a "Contact a real estate agent" note. An agent gets "Sell to player" / "Rent to player" with a nearby-players picker. Define who counts as an agent by ACE permission, job, or identifier. Config: Config.RealEstateOnlySales - enabled, global (true = all properties, false = only the ones flagged in the creator), agentpermissions = { ace, job, identifiers }. Property Reset System

Automatically wipe a property to a clean state when it changes hands - on sell-to-bank, sell-to-player, or eviction/repossession. Choose exactly what resets (bills, storage, utilities, settings). Also available as an export. Config: Config.PropertyReset - enabled, onSellToBank, onSellToPlayer, onOwnershipChange, reset = { ... }. Export: exports['rtx_housing']:ResetProperty(houseid, override).

Inactive Property Cleanup

Automatically clean up / repossess properties whose owners have gone inactive, on a schedule you control. Config: Config.InactivePropertyCleanup - enabled, inactiveDays, checkEveryMs, ignoreStarter, ignoreRented, deleteStarter.

Starter Apartments

A full starter-apartment system for new players. Auto-expiry / auto-removal of temporary or inactive starters, the option to skip utilities and bills, per-apartment furniture/wardrobe/storage and transfer/sell/list controls, and on-demand assignment. Config: Config.StarterApartments (incl. disableServices, disableBills, expireAfterDays, cantransfer, cansell, canlist), Config.GiveApartments. Export: GivePlayerApartment(source, apartmentId).

Persistent Door Locks

Save door lock states to the database and restore them on restart - so doors stay in whatever locked/unlocked state the owner left them. Works for the main door and each individual MLO door. Config: Config.PersistDoorLocks (true / false).

Furniture: Return to Inventory & Resell

Removing placed furniture can return it to the inventory instead of destroying it - so it can be placed again or resold. Optional place-after-purchase flow included. Config: Config.FurnitureSystem - removeReturnsToInventory, furnitureplaceafterpurchase, furnituredelivery, furnitureshop, furniturelimit.

Image Hosting: FiveManage Support

Property images can be uploaded via FiveManage's media library, alongside the existing Discord option. Config: Config.ImageUpload - provider ("discord" / "fivemanage"), fivemanageToken.

Flexible Payment Methods

In the purchase menu players can now choose how they pay - cash, bank card, or a custom currency. For each property you can set separately which payment methods are allowed (cash only, bank only, both, or a custom currency) - great for VIP / custom currency setups. Config: Config.PaymentMethod ("cash" / "bank" / "both") plus a per-property payment method set in the property creator, Config.CustomCurrency, Config.Currency. Property Creator Upgrades

Property list filters - live search plus filters by status (All / Owned / For Sale), type (SHELL / IPL / MLO / Starter / Complex), and availability (Sale / Rent / Both), with pagination. Copy / duplicate a property - clone an existing SHELL/IPL property (with all its settings) straight from the creator's list to quickly build similar ones. "No doors" option, and adjustable polyzone height when creating door / entry zones. Per-property custom type, public access, real-estate-only, and payment method. Config: Config.PropertyCreatorCommand, Config.PropertyCreatorFilters, Config.PropertyCreatorPermissions. Deliveries + Developer Exports & Commands

Delivery export so other scripts can drop item deliveries into a customer's property Deliveries tab: AddPropertyDelivery(houseid, delivery). Menu exports: OpenFurnitureShop, OpenPropertyMarket / OpenListings, OpenManagementMenu, ResetProperty. /giveproperty admin command - give/assign a property to any player by server id or identifier (works offline): /giveproperty [playerid | identifier] [propertyid]. /kickfromproperty admin command - kick a player out of the property they're currently inside: /kickfromproperty [playerid]. Config: Config.AdminPermissions - command (kick), givecommand, plus ace / job / identifiers. See RTX_EXPORTS.md for all exports. Full Multi-Language Support (18 Languages)

Now shipping with 18 languages: English, Czech, German, Spanish, French, Polish, Portuguese, Italian, Russian, Turkish, Korean, Dutch, Chinese, Romanian, Hungarian, Thai, Japanese, Arabic. The translation system has been made much simpler - the entire housing system can be translated through just 2 files: language/<code>.lua (all in-game text) and html/languages/<code>.json (all UI text). No more hunting through the code - everything lives in those two files, so translating the full resource is quick and clean. Interaction prompts are fully localized too. Config: Config.Language (files in language/<code>.lua and html/languages/<code>.json).

Performance & Data Handling

The property loading system has been reworked to handle a very large number of properties and data smoothly, staying responsive as your server grows. Robust automatic database migration adds new columns safely and only when missing - fully additive and production-safe.

Quality-of-Life & Polish

Numerous UI/UX refinements across menus - cleaner cards, consistent styling, live-updating panels (bills, mortgage, upgrades), and better spacing throughout.

